{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "genji-modern",
  "chunk_id": "genji-modern-chunk-0770",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00770",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "你那里人多口杂，教我怎得常到？”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "There are so many people and loose tongues where you are; how could I come often?\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00770",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "说罢便想脱身，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "After saying this, he tried to get away,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00770",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "内侍拉住了他，说道：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "but the Naishi held him back and said:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00770",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "“我从来不曾碰过这种钉子，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"I have never been rejected like this before,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00770",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "想不到这么大年纪还要受辱！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and I never imagined I would suffer such humiliation at my age!\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00770",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "说罢掩面而哭。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "With that, she covered her face and wept.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00770",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "源氏公子安慰她道：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Prince Genji comforted her, saying:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00770",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "“不久就给你消息。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"I will send you word before long.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00770",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "我心中常常想念你，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I often think of you in my heart,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00770",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "只是机会难得呀！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "but chances to meet are hard to come by!\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00770",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "说着转身就走。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "As he spoke, he turned and walked away.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00770",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "内侍拼命追上去，恨恨地说：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The Naishi desperately chased after him and said resentfully:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00770",
      "unit_index": 13,
      "source_text": "“难道‘犹如津国桥梁断’[\\[15\\]](#part1336.html#m15)么？”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"Is it really to be like 'the bridges of Tsu Province broken off'?[\\[15\\]](#part1336.html#m15)\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00770",
      "unit_index": 14,
      "source_text": "此时皇上换衣服已经完毕，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "By this time, the Emperor had finished changing his clothes,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00770",
      "unit_index": 15,
      "source_text": "隔帘望见这般模样，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and, seeing this scene from behind the curtain,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00770",
      "unit_index": 16,
      "source_text": "觉得十分可笑，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "he found it extremely amusing,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00770",
      "unit_index": 17,
      "source_text": "想道：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and thought:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00770",
      "unit_index": 18,
      "source_text": "“这毕竟是不相称的关系啊。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"After all, this is an ill-matched affair.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00770",
      "unit_index": 19,
      "source_text": "自言自语地笑着说：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Laughing as if to himself, he said:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00770",
      "unit_index": 20,
      "source_text": "“大家都说源氏公子太古板，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"Everyone says Prince Genji is far too stiff and proper,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00770",
      "unit_index": 21,
      "source_text": "替他担心，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and they worry about him,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00770",
      "unit_index": 22,
      "source_text": "原来并不如此。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "but it turns out that is not the case at all.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00770",
      "unit_index": 23,
      "source_text": "你看他连这个老女也不肯放过呢。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Look, he will not even let this old woman escape him.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00770",
      "unit_index": 24,
      "source_text": "内侍虽然觉得难以为情，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Although the Naishi felt embarrassed,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00770",
      "unit_index": 25,
      "source_text": "然而世间原有“为了心爱者，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "there have always been people in the world who say, \"For the one I love,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00770",
      "unit_index": 26,
      "source_text": "情愿穿湿衣”[\\[16\\]](#part1336.html#m16)的人，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I would gladly wear wet clothes,\"[\\[16\\]](#part1336.html#m16)",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00770",
      "unit_index": 27,
      "source_text": "所以她并不尽力替自己辩解。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "so she did not make much effort to defend herself.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
